### Professional Overview
I am a **Full-Stack Systems Architect, Certified Data Analyst, and Published Researcher** with expertise integrating scalable software infrastructure, data science, and monitoring and evaluation (MEL) frameworks. 

My work spans offline-first digital public infrastructure (DPI) for cross-border health surveillance (*HydroNexus One*), microservice cloud backends (NestJS/PostgreSQL), and quantitative evaluations for UNICEF-supported social protection projects across Malawi and Mozambique.

