### Featured Systems

- **[HydroNexus One](https://hydronexus-one.netlify.app)** \| *React 18, Node.js, MongoDB, Leaflet GIS, Arcjet*
  - Digital public infrastructure for transboundary water management and AMR surveillance across SADC. Built with real-time GIS mapping and low-bandwidth telemetry.
- **[ShopHub Platform](https://next-js-ecommerce-store-pink.vercel.app)** \| *Next.js 16, Stripe API, Zustand, Tailwind v4*
  - Subscription commerce application featuring server-side rendering, secure Stripe checkout flows, and centralized cart state logic.
- **[Classroom Management Dashboard](https://magementdashboard.netlify.app)** \| *React 19, Refine.dev, Node.js, PostgreSQL*
  - Administrative dashboard supporting automated enrollment management and role-based access control backed by serverless PostgreSQL.

